  m_text: 'Detective Lana Cole found proof that Isla Thompson was taken by someone
    powerful inside the police department.

    She knew the truth, but fear made
    her hide the evidence inside her apartment instead of exposing it.

    Now the
    room has become her unfinished confession, and every object holds a piece of
    what she could not say.'
